# Sitemap filename

The canonical sitemap for Plannio is **`client/public/sitemap_new.xml`**.

Google Search Console cached a failed fetch against `/sitemap.xml`. Do not regenerate, submit, or document `sitemap.xml` as the live sitemap.

- Generate via `scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs` → `sitemap_new.xml`
- `sitemap_index.xml` `<loc>` must be `https://plannio.eu/sitemap_new.xml`
- `robots.txt` Sitemap line must be `https://plannio.eu/sitemap_new.xml`
- In GSC/Bing submit `sitemap_new.xml` and/or `sitemap_index.xml`
- `/sitemap.xml` may only exist as a **301** to `/sitemap_new.xml` on the server — never as a urlset file in `client/public/`

```js
// BAD — writes the poisoned filename
const outPath = path.join(publicDir, "sitemap.xml");

// GOOD
const outPath = path.join(publicDir, "sitemap_new.xml");
```
